### 전체 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/invoices

### 저장
POST http://localhost:8080/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "storeName": "스타벅스",
  "amount": 4500,
  "issuedAt": "2026-08-12T10:00:00",
  "category": "카페"
}

### 단건 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/invoices/1

### 수정
PUT http://localhost:8080/invoices/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "storeName": "스타벅스 강남점",
  "amount": 5000,
  "issuedAt": "2026-08-14T10:00:00",
  "category": "카페"
}

### 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/invoices/1
